# Osseous Exhale: "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may behold a Dragon. This spell deals 5 damage to target attacking or
# blocking creature. If a Dragon was beheld, you gain 2 life." Bot2 attacks with its Memnite on turn 4 (the Ornithopter stays home and
# is no legal target, CR 506.3). Bot1 reveals Kokusho from its hand to behold a Dragon (CR 701.4a); the Memnite takes 5 and dies, and
# Bot1 gains 2 life. Kokusho stays in the hand and is revealed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Osseous Exhale
Kokusho, the Evening Star
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Osseous Exhale.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Behold a Dragon)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Choose(Kokusho, the Evening Star)
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot1.Revealed = Kokusho, the Evening Star
Bot1.Graveyard = Osseous Exhale
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
